{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":169.5,"mirrow":false,"y":-406,"img":"chara031_0","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]你问我的爵士头衔？这是我早在克里斯汀就已经获得的荣耀。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]我们是武家贵族，自幼就会接受严格的战斗训练。[r]在很小的时候我们就会参与战斗，所以我们也比其他人更早配得上这个荣耀头衔。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]这荣耀一直支撑着我前行，哪怕被困在深渊，我也一直保持着那份身为爵士的荣耀。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"波特温","text":"[show]莫非你对这些头衔也感兴趣吗？不过你们工匠在克里斯汀可很难有立足之处啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"波特温-熟识1","script":"yd_031_04"}